Substitute the given values into the ratio:
\frac{v_{p}}{v_{\alpha}} = \frac{4m_{p} \times 2\lambda}{m_{p} \times \lambda} = \frac{8m_{p}\lambda}{m_{p}\lambda} = 8:1

